flowchart LR
    A[Approved brand data] --> B[Redact PII, tag source, encrypt per brand]
    B --> C[Refresh brand retrieval]
    B --> D{Enough eligible data?}
    D -- No --> E[Keep current version]
    D -- Yes --> F[G1 data gate]
    F --> G[Train candidate adapter]
    G --> H[G2 quality, G3 leakage, G4 latency]
    H -- Pass --> I[Register version, move prod pointer]
    H -- Fail --> E
    I --> J[Monitor, roll back if needed]
